"Guess the Impression."

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:12.545
-♪ Guess the impression ♪

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:14.913
♪ Guess the impression ♪

00:00:14.913 --> 00:00:16.515
-Oh, that was a good one.

00:00:16.515 --> 00:00:18.284 line:0%
So, in front of each of us

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:20.086 line:0%
is a stack of cards...
-I'm nervous.

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:21.787 line:0%
-...with celebrities' names
on them.

00:00:21.787 --> 00:00:23.390 line:0%
Now, on your turn,
you draw a card

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:26.059 line:0%
and you have to do an impression
of whoever it is on the card,

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:28.094 line:0%
trying to get the other person
to guess.

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:30.196 line:0%
And you want to get
the other player to guess

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.298 line:0%
as many as possible
before the timer runs out.

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:33.967 line:0%
-Okay, but full disclosure --

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:37.136 line:0%
