our arsenal of magic action.

00:00:37.136 --> 00:00:38.771 line:0%
This can just be
whatever happens.

00:00:38.771 --> 00:00:40.940 line:0%
I don't know what's in the box.
-Yeah, I have not --

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:43.843 line:0%
-"What's in the box, Larry?
What's in the box?" Okay.

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:45.345 line:0%
-Wait. That's not
a first one, right?

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:46.979 line:0%
-No, it isn't.
-Alright, here we go.

00:00:46.979 --> 00:00:49.549 line:0%
No, these are not --
I don't know what names are on.

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:51.084 line:0%
