-Nope.

00:00:51.084 --> 00:00:52.652 line:0%
-These aren't
our go-to impressions.

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:54.587 line:0%
-Correct.
-Alight. You're up first.

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:57.123 line:0%
Ready, set --
I'm gonna try to guess.

00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:58.691 line:0%
